  "detail": null,
  "summary": "CRC outreach worklist for Okafor CRC 2026 (grp-okafor-crc, 4 members), worked per RBC-QM-02. Three have open gaps and got a FIT kit order and outreach message; one is excluded.\n\n| Patient | Status | Reason |\n|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow (72) | Open gap | Looked excluded at first (active frailty plus donepezil), but Dr. Lin marked the frailty diagnosis (cond-00189) entered in error while I worked (comm-00301), so the exclusion fails. No nursing home, hospice or CRC. No qualifying screening on record. FIT ordered (sr-t0004), message sent (comm-t0007). |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan (52) | Excluded | Hospice care 06/16–08/21/2026 (eoc-00002, finished), confirmed by the St. Brigid discharge summary (doc-00402). Revoking hospice doesn't remove the exclusion. No order, no contact. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss (52) | Open gap | Looked up to date at first (negative FIT shown as collected 01/05/2026). A corrected report (obs-01732) moved collection to 12/31/2025, before the 2026 period. No other screening. FIT ordered (sr-t0005), message sent (comm-t0006). |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver (51) | Open gap | Her 06/11/2024 stool DNA test (obs-01871) belonged to another patient; Harbor Lab withdrew it (doc-00401). The 2025 colonoscopy order (sr-00003, still active) was never done, and an order doesn't count. FIT ordered (sr-t0001), message sent (comm-t0002). |\n\n- **Messages:** each one says the kit is on its way, explains how to collect and return it by 12/31/2026, and says nothing false about past screening. FIT windows are 10/23–12/31/2026.\n- **Notes:** a signed note for each patient citing RBC-QM-02 (doc-t0003, doc-t0008, doc-t0009, doc-t0010).\n- **Arrivals:** the four items that came in while I worked (inbox-a0001 to a0004) are reviewed and closed. a0001 and a0003 changed decisions for pt-0009 and pt-0022; a0002 confirmed pt-0020's exclusion; a0004 confirmed the pt-0024 open gap. No orders or messages had gone out on the earlier readings, so nothing needed undoing.\n\nNeeds follow-up:\n- obs-01871 (pt-0024) is still marked final in the chart even though the lab withdrew it. It should be corrected or marked entered in error.\n- sr-00003, pt-0024's 2025 colonoscopy order, is still open.\n\nOlder unrelated inbox items (non-CRC results and refill requests) were left alone.",
